    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44490" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sītarchĭa</span></b> , ae,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιταρχία</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Provisions for a journey</i>,
				<i><span class="en">App. M. 2, p. 119, 29</span></i>; Hier.
			Comment. in Matt. <i>med.</i>; Vit. Malch. 10; Schol.
